# One host, one address. Two hostnames serving the same pages is the duplicate
# a search engine has to pick between, and a canonical tag is a hint rather
# than an instruction -- a 301 is the instruction.
https://www.scantobid.app/* https://scantobid.app/:splat 301
http://www.scantobid.app/* https://scantobid.app/:splat 301
